    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_sys_01_old",
      "hash": "fbf74f0e63896efe",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 7]"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_05_old",
      "hash": "161b4bb43a176cca",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 8]"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_poke_02",
      "hash": "0cfbc97cbaa45b1b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 9]"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_01",
      "hash": "5941293e3724d390",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "ASSISTANT: So you came!\\nThen let’s get down to brass tacks.\\c\\nI’ve got something good to show you."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_08",
      "hash": "5941323e3724e2db",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Believe it or not, I have mastered\\nthe [VAR COLOR(0006)]Secret Technique Light Up[VAR COLOR(0000)]!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_09",
      "hash": "5941313e3724e128",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Now, let me turn off the lights, and..."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_02",
      "hash": "59412c3e3724d8a9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "There, nice and dark!\\nNow, if you calm your heart...\\c\\nand breathe deeply...you will be able to sense\\nyour surroundings, no matter how dark it is!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_03",
      "hash": "59412b3e3724d6f6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "See? It seems bright, even with the lights off.\\c\\nMy keen focus spreads to those around me,\\nyou see.\\c\\nHere, I can teach you how to do it, too!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_pikachu_01",
      "hash": "701a1e6d114892aa",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Pika chu!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_eievui_01",
      "hash": "7322242f70db9f68",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Veeee!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_04",
      "hash": "59412e3e3724dc0f",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "ASSISTANT: ...Huh? It seems [VAR POKNAME(0002)]\\nwants to learn it instead, [VAR TRNAME(0000)]."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_10",
      "hash": "593dc43e3721f21a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "What?! And you say it already knows the Secret\\nTechnique Chop Down?"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_11",
      "hash": "593dc53e3721f3cd",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I see! Professor Oak had mentioned it, but it\\nreally does seem that your [VAR POKNAME(0002)]\\r\\nis special!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_05",
      "hash": "59412d3e3724da5c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Fascinating! Let me try to teach it!\\nHere, let me turn off the lights again."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_06",
      "hash": "5941303e3724df75",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Now, [VAR POKNAME(0002)]!\\nFollow what I do.\\c\\nCalm your heart...\\nbreathe deeply and...\\c\\nsense...your surroundings!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_sys_01",
      "hash": "05efed7b7c713db0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR PKNICK(0003)] learned the [VAR COLOR(0006)]Secret Technique[VAR COLOR(0000)]\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]Light Up[VAR COLOR(0000)]!"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_07",
      "hash": "59412f3e3724ddc2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Your [VAR POKNAME(0002)]—it really is\\nquite wonderful!"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_12",
      "hash": "593dc23e3721eeb4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Now, use Secret Techniques to your heart’s\\ncontent!\\c\\nSince they’re not moves, you can use them even\\nif your Pokémon doesn’t have the energy\\r\\nto battle!"
    }
  ],
